Fixtures for TestPgpverify* (pgpverify_test.go).

trustedkeys.gpg  public keyring of a throwaway ed25519 key with the user id
                 "news.announce.newgroups"; the private key was not kept.
good.art         a newgroup control message for e2e.test.group signed with
                 that key the way signcontrol does (detached text-mode
                 signature over X-Signed-Headers, the signed headers, a blank
                 line and the body), with the signature in X-PGP-Sig.

The tests derive the other cases from good.art (changed or duplicated
headers, NUL bytes, bare CR).  To make new fixtures: gpg --quick-gen-key
news.announce.newgroups ed25519 sign never in a scratch GNUPGHOME, sign the
text as above with gpg --textmode --detach-sign --armor, and export the
public key with gpg --export.
